{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5456","title":"Xiaomi Brings Mijia Home Appliances to Global Markets, including Washer, \r\nRefrigerator, and Air Conditioner Models","desc":"Xiaomi Expands Mijia Smart Home Series to Global Markets","view_cnt":"4765","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1757930662","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/260_operatorx_operatorx_opx/16/09/2025/e7b6e4211dc09a32e75a12986651450d.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e[Munich, GERMANY, September 24, 2025\u003c/strong\u003e] – Xiaomi today announced the global launch of the new Mijia home appliances, including Mijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg, and Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco Series. These new additions further advance Xiaomi's \"Human x Car x Home\" smart ecosystem strategy, delivering a seamlessly connected and more intelligent lifestyle experience to consumers worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Mijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L provides families with a versatile, high-capacity storage solution, featuring customizable temperature zones and Ag⁺ freshness technology for longer-lasting food preservation.² The Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg introduces a premium, energy-efficient laundry experience, optimizing hygiene while reducing water and power consumption. Completing the lineup, the Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco Series combines intelligent climate control with AI-driven energy efficiency, ensuring year-round comfort tailored to every household.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully integrated into the Xiaomi AIoT and Mijia smart home ecosystems, these appliances transform everyday living into a more connected, effortless experience. With unified management through the Xiaomi Home app, users gain access to real-time notifications, personalized settings, and seamless OTA software upgrades anywhere in the world. Enhanced further by compatibility with Google Assistant and Alexa, Mijia appliances bring a new level of convenience and intelligence into the home.³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L: Intelligent, versatile food storage\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for intelligent living, Mijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L offers efficient refrigeration and versatile storage in a premium design well-suited for modern family life. Created for households that purchase groceries in bulk, it offers flexible multi-zone storage options. These include an i Fresh convertible zone with -1°C to 5°C¹\u003cem\u003e \u003c/em\u003etemperature control, and an optimized solution for storing a range of fresh food types. Its 502L capacity includes individually controlled temperature zones, complemented by Auto, Super Cool, and Super Freeze modes for adaptable storage scenarios. The integration of Ag⁺ freshness technology² helps minimize odors and inhibit bacterial growth, keeping food fresher for longer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned with convenience, the refrigerator features a 90° door opening that provides full access even when installed against walls. Real-time notifications via the Xiaomi Home app alert users if the door is left ajar for more than two minutes, helping reduce potential food waste. Dual inverter technology ensures quiet operation and excellent energy efficiency, while built-in Wi-Fi enables remote temperature adjustments.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/212_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/09/2025/40c5249e0915446ff3e036d654de5696.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg: An advanced, all-in-one laundry solution\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFocusing firmly on energy efficiency and quiet operation, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg features a 570mm¹ deep, ultra-slim design that fits easily into any living space. Its 525mm¹ extra-large drum and high-performance direct drive motor uses Power Wash technology,⁴ a durable belt-free design that creates a stronger centrifugal force, ensuring deeper cleaning, and near noise-free operation. Optimized for power efficiency, the design also delivers a 25%⁵ savings advantage above the EU Energy Class A baseline.⁵ Created to deliver cleaner, softer garment washing, Dual Auto Dosing ensures the optimal amount of detergent and fabric softener is used.⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdaptable for all situations, its all-in-one wash-to-dry option can wash up to 3kg of laundry in a mere 180 minutes.⁷ Furthermore, Smart Infusion technology uses high-pressure in-drum spraying to achieve Smart Wash deep cleaning in just 36 minutes,⁸ resulting in 39% less washing time, 33% less water, and 40% less energy consumption.⁹ Alternatively, Quick Wash completes a full load in just 12 minutes,¹⁰ perfect for lightly soiled garments or last-minute washing needs. To deliver powerful fabric hygiene, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg uses high-temperature steam washing to remove up to 99.99% of bacteria.¹¹ To revitalize clothes without using water, Refresh mode¹² uses steam to gently penetrate fibers to reduce unwanted wrinkles. Users can also enjoy fresher and fragrance-infused clothing without using a fabric softener, with Aromatherapy Wash¹³ adding aroma liquid to the drum. Smart drying modes take advantage of high-precision sensors and advanced 3D airflow technology - allowing Smart Dry Control¹⁴ to monitor humidity to achieve optimal dryness, while Gentle Drying¹⁵ maintains a steady low temperature between 55°C and 65°C¹⁵ to help minimize shrinkage and damage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn addition, hygiene across all key appliance areas is achieved with comprehensive self-cleaning routines. These include all-around detergent drawer cleaning,¹⁶ self-rinsing to reduce lint buildup, high-temperature drum cleaning to remove bacteria between cycles, and auto door rinse, which flushes both gasket and door.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/807_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/09/2025/157ae7d2780d4b5f24556a097b119a65.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco Series: Outstanding energy efficiency and control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvailable in 2.6 kW and 3.5 kW variants,¹⁷ Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco series delivers maximum energy efficiency, minimizing environmental impact and lowering energy bills. Carrying an EU-certified A+++¹⁸ energy efficiency rating in both cooling and warm-climate heating,¹⁸ it offers energy-conscious users a smarter and more precise indoor climate management experience, combining high-performance output with minimal energy consumption.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLeveraging Mijia AI Energy Saving mode,¹⁹ Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco series dynamically adjusts output in response to real-world environmental changes, improving energy efficiency by up to 27%¹⁹ compared to conventional solutions. Reducing energy consumption without sacrificing essential comfort, Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco series delivers intelligent temperature control, with 30-second²º quick cooling and 60-second²º rapid heating. Micro-hole air flaps and 14 swing blades offering soft airflow that avoid direct blowing, plus Turbo mode to accelerate fan speed to ensure consistent cooling and heating. Meanwhile, users can also monitor and adjust power usage using Xiaomi Home app. The app provides access to control settings, filter status, and energy consumption data, plus custom nighttime profiles for optimal sleeping comfort.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, its Personalize via AI feature intelligently learns user habits and dynamically adjusts settings to create a comfortable climate tailored specifically to their needs. Support for Google Assistant voice commands²¹ enables simple temperature adjustments, while smart lighting and room size detection appropriately adapt airflow and display brightness. Smart maintenance tools, such as filter cleaning reminders, easy-to-remove filter, high-temperature auto cleaning and comprehensive OTA, also help reduce maintenance and extend lifespan, consolidating users' effortless and sustainable lifestyles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/85_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/16/09/2025/3609d8b58d7f9fb0af7ac7bfea5696e5.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg, and Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco series will be available through Xiaomi's official channels and authorized retailers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Mijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L: Priced starting at EUR 849\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg: Priced starting at EUR 579\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco 3.5 kW: Priced starting at EUR 699\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e·\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco 2.6 kW: Priced starting at EUR 599\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images are available here: \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Enc97dl3sspHq7gIcRsAY40BgZ6XNIBiXNpfV15SEhrysA?e=mFDPPt\"\u003eMijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Esi-P5NSyeNPvDJalUqTYIsBBFQiQ5AmYtFCFJjLM5Efng?e=060zqu\"\u003eMijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EvE-L8JEadxJnlQnJ3Af45EBg0UuyyavHTscwKJyt2GRBQ?e=CWoIRW\"\u003eMijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease visit the official Xiaomi website for more detailed information on these products and their features:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/smart-home/\"\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/smart-home/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/a\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2025, the MAU reached approximately 731.2 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 989.1 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of June 30, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human x Car x Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Data obtained from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² Ag⁺ Fresh is available in the refrigerator compartment (including the customizable-temperature drawer) only. Tested by CVC Testing Technology Co., Ltd. for the pollutants trimethylamine and methyl mercaptan, report No.: WTS2025-2849-3, and the microorganisms Staphylococcus aureus and Escherichia coli, report No.: WTS2025-2849-1.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ A compatible Alexa or Google Assistant-enabled device is required. Google Assistant is not available in some languages and countries or regions. Google, Google Home, and Google Nest Mini are trademarks of Google LLC. Alexa is not available in some languages and countries or regions. Amazon, Alexa, and all related trademarks belong to \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://Amazon.com\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eAmazon.com\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e, Inc. Please refer to the respective official websites for more information.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ Power Wash function is only available in Smart Wash and Cold Wash modes.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ The product is claimed to be 25% more energy-efficient in washing than the minimum threshold for Class A, as defined in EU Regulation 2019/2014. Testing was conducted by TÜV SÜD Certification and Testing (China) Co., Ltd., Report No. 4840125999962. This information is provided for reference only and does not represent an official EU energy label or class.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ For certain special materials or specific wash programs, dual auto dosing is not supported, and detergent must be added manually. Do not add laundry powder into the dispenser drawer.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ Tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs under standard water pressure, environment, and temperature conditions, with a 3kg standard IEC load. Actual performance may vary depending on fabric type and actual usage conditions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs. For lightweight 1-2kg loads, the Smart wash program automatically allocates washing time based on smart weighing. Actual duration may vary depending on fabric type and actual usage scenarios.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ Compared to Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer 10.5kg (Model: WD105MJA10MY), the Smart Wash program of Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg (Model: WD090MJA11EU) is approximately 39% more time-efficient, 33% more water-efficient, and 40% more energy-efficient when washing lightweight loads (1-2 kg). Data based on testing conducted by Xiaomi Internal Labs under controlled conditions. Actual performance may vary depending on usage environment and laundry composition.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ 12-min: Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs. For lightweight 1–2 kg loads, Quick Wash runs on a fixed 12-minute cycle without automatic time adjustment.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ Tested by TÜV SÜD Certification and Testing (China) Co., Ltd. Shanghai Branch in accordance with IEC/PAS 62958:2015, MOD. Under laboratory conditions, the Hygiene program achieved a \u0026gt;99.9999% reduction of Staphylococcus aureus and Escherichia coli. Actual results may vary depending on usage conditions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² Refresh care: Tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. This program effectively removes odors and wrinkles from 1 to 3 shirts or similar garments. Clothes may be slightly damp at the end of the cycle, but can be air-dried before use. This feature is suitable for cotton, linen, and synthetic fiber blends, but not recommended for delicate fabrics such as silk or wool.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ Aromatherapy Wash: Tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Adding a recommended amount of fragrance liquid to a small load of clothes (1-2kg) will leave the laundry delicately fragranced. Clothes may be slightly damp at the end of the program, but can be air-dried before use. This feature is suitable for cotton, linen, and synthetic fiber blends, but not recommended for delicate fabrics such as silk or wool. For best results, pour the fragrance liquid directly into the drum before adding clothes and running the cycle. Avoid using fragrance liquids that contain alcohol.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴ Smart dry control: Tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs against the IEC61121 test standard. Dry Only program with 1/3/5kg load, as per IEC guidelines, resulted in a moisture content of ≤3.0% at the end of the cycle. Results may vary based on ambient temperature and water pressure.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁵ 55°C to 65°C: Tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. During the wash and dry cycle of the Down program, the surface temperature of a 1kg load was measured using a wireless temperature sensor and was found to range from 55°C to 65°C while drying. Temperatures may exceed this range during the initial and final stages of the drying process. Results may vary depending on ambient temperature and water pressure.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁶ Only one drawer can be cleaned at a time. Improper use may void the warranty.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁷ Vary by regions\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁸ Heating efficiency is rated separately for different EU climate zones—'Warm' (A+++) and 'Average' (A++)—in accordance with EU energy labeling regulations for air conditioners to better reflect real-life performance.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁹ According to Intertek's test reports, models ASH-09WO/N1C3-EU and ASH-12WO/N1C3-EU achieved 26.1% and 27.4% energy savings, respectively, with and without Mijia AI Energy Saving Mode. Tested under the following temperatures: indoor room 32°C, indoor wall 30°C, outdoor 35°C; duration: 3 hours. Actual performance may vary depending on room size, ambient temperature, installation, and user habits.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²º According to Intertek's test reports, under specified initial conditions, the indoor unit outlet temperature decreased to below 19°C within 30 seconds in cooling mode (outdoor: 35°C DBT; indoor: 27°C DBT and 19°C WBT), and increased to above 37°C within 1 minute in heating mode (outdoor: 7°C DBT and 6°C WBT; indoor: 20°C DBT). Actual performance may vary depending on environmental conditions, installation quality, and user settings.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²¹ A compatible Google Assistant-enabled device is required. Google Assistant is not available in some languages and countries or regions. Google, Google Home, and Google Nest Mini are trademarks of Google LLC. Please refer to the respective official websites for more information.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"818","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1758720632"},"common":null}